# A settings row that is a verb, and what a section looks like once its groups are cards.
#
# Radio actions is the screen this was written for, and the one worth watching: eleven rows that
# all said "press A" in their value column, under group labels that were dim text wedged between
# them. The instruction was noise - the action bar three rows below names A for the whole screen,
# and a column of identical words is a column the eye has to skip to reach the labels, which are
# the only part that differs. What is there instead is what the words were carrying alone: a
# symbol in a tonal disc at the leading edge, and a weight.
#
# Three things to watch, and none of them is new machinery. The node detail's action card has
# drawn verbs this way since it was written; this is the settings renderer catching up.
#
#   - The red is spent twice on the whole screen. Everything in this section costs something, so
#     "destructive" is the baseline rather than the exception, and what the colour marks is where
#     there is no way back - the two factory resets. A reboot is amber: nothing is lost, you wait.
#   - A group is a card, and its heading stands plainly in the break above it. Neither costs a
#     row, and the heading is the same one every other section draws - a card header with a disc
#     out at the card's edge is the node detail's shape, not a field list's.
#   - A withdrawn verb keeps its place, its symbol and its column, and says why on the trailing
#     edge. A section whose length changes when the radio drops moves the cursor out from under
#     whoever was reading it.

scene demo
scale 4
delay 220
config

tab settings
hold 900

# Into Radio actions. Five cards, a gradient of weights down them, and not one "press A".
key down 14
key a
hold 2400

# Down through the groups. The cursor walks rows, not cards, and the disc under it brightens to
# the family's full strength rather than dissolving into the cursor fill.
key down 3
hold 1200
key down 4
hold 1600

# The two rows that say how much they would take. A verb with something to state puts it where a
# trailing age goes rather than in a capsule: "21 nodes" is a figure to weigh, not a count that
# shouts.
offradio all
hold 2000

# And the same section with the link gone. Same rows, same order, same symbols - every offer
# withdrawn, each saying why, and the two forget rows still live because they send nothing. This
# is the shape MESH_UI_SETTING_ACTION_OFF exists for: a section whose length changed when the
# radio dropped would move the cursor out from under whoever was reading it.
link down
hold 2600

link up
hold 1200

# The other end of the change: a section that is mostly fields, with its presses at the foot.
# LoRa's "Ham mode" group is three values and then the switch that applies them, and it is one
# card - a group is one card whatever is in it. The leading slot is reserved for every row of
# every open section, so the switch's disc lands in the gutter its neighbours were already
# holding open and the labels line up down the card.
key b
hold 800
key down 6
key a
hold 900
key down 40
hold 2600
